; The module half of the macro-qualification fixtures (368, 369).
; Two exported macros - one parameterful, one zero-parameter, so both
; invocation spellings of a QUALIFIED reference are exercised - and a
; private one, which stays reachable from nowhere else however it is
; spelled.
(pub macro (qdbl x) (+ x x))
(pub macro (qfive) 5)
(macro (qsecret x) (+ x 100))
